<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-21T02:42:19.983Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 02:42:19 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen repeatedly assaulted former Super Eagles captain Segun Odegbami at his home in Abeokuta, wounding him but he survived the machete attack. Security personnel continued to be targeted, with a university guard killed while returning home with his wife and another guard shot dead in Plateau, while gunmen also attacked a mining site in Plateau, leaving three feared dead, and shot a herder dead in the same state. Police launched a manhunt for the assailants of Odegbami and vowed to apprehend the perpetrators. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxQcnF0SWxTNS1iSmo1T2pCdTVmbV9VUngxb1l4VmhGVFV1VWlhNUVyWGdxWFVjZXBqRWhyZjFFMGZuRFc5NHdIQ2toQm02X19qSnhGaDk5Z3JQSEtVbXZJSFAzSGE1aTBuWEJSc3FBX2t4TEtsRElWbkVDME5zcEs0QWlR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Legit News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxOUkE4OHZVVnJUNmNhWkdzX0lGLTk1YWtvbXVOOWFBRFB0a2Y5SHFRV096TmxQNDVHa2ZISHMxSWJsVmFDczE0M0k0eXlPeUZMQ3FfSWZPNURUN2tCU19iUU9FZkgwQmJYUi1HTlNWbFhqdU5sRk92Q3JMNDQyQjR1eGExZnJDUUl3dkxhSUpaZlp4WElX?oc=5&quot;&gt;LEADERSHIP Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYEFVX3lxTE44TG1YN2N0aldSZ3VhY3F3YWtBc0FzN05Sb1M4WHZjdVgyejJNNVRfWHg4ZnZ4S2k3NlRHRnVCVWpJZEhISWtwM1M0bjBwNHFDazFXdjgwLXdQaVdVMUxncA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Trust&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxPTHB6dnV2Q1NrZE5lVEgtMVhWS2RkekZzNExVLWFHYVBMWEpxYnkxWXIxcTR2YV9LRkQ2Z295SGRaNldQblhVZGF5ekxNSTlweFo3WEtyT2VOZm5VUVBTY1B2bEtDVkRfQnVZVmFud3ZMZUFmbVN2elMxUGJBaVlXNjluMUg?oc=5&quot;&gt;LEADERSHIP Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxNSUY5Q1QxR0hXSWE1WFdIZ0NjZ3NGVWJCX0FhdllZTDNxdTZBX0N4bHZYZkVoZGxiT0ZOSW9oUW9lQzB1dXgzc